{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2022-01-11 15:30:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE ANNOUNCES U.S. EPA REGISTRATION OF ENLIST ONE® AND ENLIST DUO® HERBICIDES THROUGH 2029', 'text': 'WILMINGTON,\xa0DEL., JAN. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT THE U.S. ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION AGENCY (EPA) HAS COMPLETED THE REGISTRATION AMENDMENT PROCESS FOR ENLIST ONE®\xa0AND ENLIST DUO®\xa0HERBICIDES, GIVING FARMERS CERTAINTY IN PRODUCT AVAILABILITY AS THEY COMPLETE THEIR 2022 SEED PLANTING AND CROP PROTECTION PLANS.'}